@startuml
title SC-ORD-012 — Paid, then the stock is gone: refunded, then rejected
actor Administrator as A
participant "Order\n(saga)" as O
participant "Inventory" as I
participant "Payment" as P
participant "Payment\nprovider" as PSP
participant "Notification" as N

note over O #FFF8E1 : SUSPENDED\norder UNDER_REVIEW\npayment captured
note over I : was down longer than\nthe reservation lifetime
A -> O : RetryOrderUnderReview, with a comment
O ->> I : ConfirmReservation
note over I : reservation expired;\ntries to reserve again:\nthe stock is gone
I ->> O : ReservationConfirmationFailed
note over O : REFUNDING_PAYMENT
O ->> P : RefundPayment
P -> PSP : refund
PSP --> P : refunded
P ->> O : PaymentRefunded
note over O #FFCDD2 : COMPENSATED\norder REJECTED, OUT_OF_STOCK
O ->> N : OrderRejected (payment refunded)
@enduml
